</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>the stream to use for output.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>MRI</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>register information that helps emit register names insteead of raw register numbers.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>IsEH</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>true if the DWARF Call Frame Information is from .eh_frame instead of from .debug_frame. This is needed for register number conversion because some register numbers differ between the two sections for certain architectures like x86.</para>
